    Cell["The canonical description is a RuleDelayed of the form {in1, in2, \
...} :> {out1, out2, ...}. Rule is warned best-effort compatibility because \
its right-hand side may evaluate before capture.", "Notes", 
     CellID -> 200014], Cell["Axis terms include named blanks, bare or string \
names, literal and unit axes, products, direct sums, named or anonymous \
sequences, and repeated groups.", "Notes", CellID -> 200015], 
    Cell["The whole left-hand side is one binder scope: repeated a_ \
occurrences denote the same logical axis, while a bare a on the left remains \
an ambient expression. A bare a is localized only on the right from the \
completed binder environment or an explicit sized declaration.", "Notes", 
     CellID -> 200016], Cell["Annotation[axis, n] and Labeled[n, axis] add an \
inline positive-integer size. They compose in either nesting order with valid \
Slot, Highlighted, and Framed targeting wrappers.", "Notes", 
     CellID -> 200017], Cell["Targeted string axes use Slot[\"name\"], \
Highlighted[\"name\"], or Framed[\"name\"]. Targeted symbol axes use \
Highlighted or Framed.", "Notes", CellID -> 200018], 
    Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{"TraceAction", "None", 
